# Building a Sports Highlight Intelligence App with TwelveLabs Marengo, Pegasus, and Jockey
## [Section 3: Build Highlight Lanes with Jockey](https://www.twelvelabs.io/blog/sports-semantic-jockey#section-3-build-highlight-lanes-with-jockey)
### [3.1 - Grounding Jockey in the Game Knowledge Store](https://www.twelvelabs.io/blog/sports-semantic-jockey#3.1---grounding-jockey-in-the-game-knowledge-store)
```
def create_knowledge_store(spec):
    metadata = {
        "game_tag": spec["tag"],
        "source": "sports-jockey",
    }

    return twelvelabs_create_knowledge_store(
        name=spec["knowledge_store_name"],
        ingestion_config={
            "enrichment_config": {
                "type": "json_schema",
                "json_schema": SPORTS_HIGHLIGHT_INGESTION_SCHEMA,
            }
        },
        metadata=metadata,
    )
```
